gui.button.vampire=Vampires
gui.button.werewolf=Werewolfs
gui.button.HowTurnVampire=How to turn vampire
gui.button.HowTurnWerewolf=How to turn werewolf
gui.button.HowTurnHunter=How to turn hunter
gui.button.drinkBlood=Drink blood
gui.button.unlockSkillVPLB=Unlock new skill
vampire_craft_book.HowTurnVampire1=It's possible to become a vampire by using a vampire tooth or by being bitten by one, although the chances are low in the latter case. Vampires can be found in the dark forest, where it's the easiest place to become a vampire. The vampire tooth item has a 50% chance of dropping when defeating a vampire.
vampire_craft_book.HowTurnVampire2=The transformation takes 5 minutes, and you'll be able to track the time through the hunger effect added to the player. At the end of the time, you'll receive an item called "Vampire skills," where you can choose and use vampire abilities.
vampire_craft_book.HowTurnVampire3=If you want to avoid becoming a vampire, within the 5 minutes, you can prevent it by heating a bucket of milk in the furnace and drinking the hot milk bucket.

vampire_craft_book.drinkBlood1=Only when you're a vampire will you feel a new type of hunger, the thirst for blood. With the thirst indicator located just above the hunger indicator, you can monitor the vampire's thirst level.
vampire_craft_book.drinkBlood2=The vampire's thirst cannot be satisfied with regular food; you need to drink blood to fill the blood thirst bar. You can do this in two ways: by drinking blood bottles, which can be obtained by biting a mob while holding a glass bottle, or by finding them in structures throughout the world. The second method is to drink directly from the source by tapping the button on the screen or the interaction button with empty hands.
vampire_craft_book.drinkBlood3=If the thirst bar reaches zero, the vampire will become weaker and won't be able to use its abilities anymore, losing all its resistance abilities temporarily.

vampire_craft_book.HowTurnWerewolf1=It's possible to become a werewolf by using a werewolf fang or by being bitten by one, although the chances are low in the latter case. Werewolves can be found in the dark forest, where it's the easiest place to become a werewolf. The werewolf fang item has a 50% chance of dropping when defeating a werewolf.
vampire_craft_book.HowTurnWerewolf2=The transformation takes 5 minutes, and you'll be able to track the time through the hunger effect added to the player. At the end of the time, you'll receive an item called "Werewolf skills," where you can choose and use werewolf abilities.
vampire_craft_book.HowTurnWerewolf3=If you want to avoid becoming a werewolf, within the 5 minutes, you can prevent it by heating a bucket of milk in the furnace and drinking the hot milk bucket.

gui.button.niveisLB=Werewolf levels
vampire_craft_book.unlockSkillVP1=After becoming a vampire, you can unlock new skills. To do this, you need a blood altar and full bottles of blood.
vampire_craft_book.unlockSkillVP2=Once the altar is full, just use a vampire tooth on the altar. A screen will appear with the skills not yet unlocked; you need enough XP to unlock them.
vampire_craft_book.unlockSkillLB1=After becoming a werewolf, you can unlock new skills. To do this, you need a blood altar and to use werewolf liver.
vampire_craft_book.unlockSkillLB2=When the altar is full, just use a werewolf tusk on the altar. A screen will appear with the skills not yet unlocked; you need enough XP to unlock them; you also need to have the specific werewolf level depending on the skill (see more about this in the topic below here in the book).
vampire_craft_book.niveisLB1=After becoming a werewolf, you receive the werewolf level §mI§r. You can level up by killing werewolves of a higher level than you. The order of strength is §mI§r - white (beta), §mII§r - bluish (omega) and §mIII§r - black (alpha).
vampire_craft_book.commands.removeLB=function sunrise/removeLB: Removes the player's transformation instantly into a werewolf
vampire_craft_book.commands.removeVP=function sunrise/removeVP: Removes the player's transformation instantly into a vampire

