vampire_craft_book.howUpLevel1=Unlike vampires and werewolves, hunters do not unlock abilities.  
vampire_craft_book.howUpLevel2=Hunters can level up their attributes by completing quests for a "Hunter Trainer," who can be found throughout the world.  
hunter_book.info1= - The stamina level improves physical strength and body energy.  
hunter_book.info2= - The mana level determines the amount of magical energy.  
hunter_book.info3= - The mastery level. A minimum mastery level is required to use weapons.  
hunter_book.info4= - The proficiency level improves the use of certain weapons, items, and tool crafting.  


