vampire_craft_book.HowTurnHunter1=You can turn into a hunter by using a syringe with garlic on yourself, it takes 5 minutes, you can see the remaining time by the hunger effect.
vampire_craft_book.HowTurnHunter2=Then you can choose a type of hunter, see the button below.
vampire_craft_book.huntersSkill1=Hunter skills improve hunter attributes and this only applies to real hunters and church hunters. Lone hunters only have the skills of their choice (vampire or werewolf).
vampire_craft_book.huntersSkill2=The skill item is used to unlock skills. They can be bought with xp.
gui.button.huntersTypes=Hunter types
vampire_craft_book.huntersTypes1=Church hunter: Church hunters are subordinates of the church, they can trade and interact with the priest.
vampire_craft_book.huntersTypes2=Royal hunter: These are royal hunters subordinate to the king, they act at the king's will and receive royal benefits.
vampire_craft_book.huntersTypes3=Lone hunter: They receive no orders from anyone and no benefits from either side, they can transform into vampires or werewolves and receive the special ability to blend in with humans.

